// k_asm_parser_thin_delegate table + its 2 consumers stayed host-cc in
//   pipeline_asm_parser_emit_heavy.c (relocated, same TU). Residual host-cc
//   callee asm_env_entry_emit_heavy via extern. Cold twins under seed
